 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Not creepy, just fascinating. Do you enjoy reading mysteries but hate reading in bed because of the light? Then audiobooks are perfect for you. Do you enjoy reading mysteries but hate reading in bed because of the light? Then audiobooks are perfect for you. Then listen to some true crime ones at bedtime. They' much shorter than mysteries and don't need as bright a light. Not at all. The people being talked about are usually dead and can't hear it. It' the family and friends who matter who have heard it before. Then skip them. There's a mix of funny and sad ones. Fun thing to do with a drink after work. Some people play golf or go for a walk. I listen to true crime.",
